# ADDITIONAL ADMIN FRONTEND REQUIREMENTS — CRUD + REPORTS

These are ADDITIONAL requirements for the existing NEPTUNE Admin Dashboard.

The Admin Dashboard is already working.

Do NOT redesign the application.

Do NOT break existing functionality.

---

# 1. COMPLETE CRUD OPERATIONS

Audit every Admin management section and make sure the UI supports the CRUD operations actually available from the backend.

Check:

* Collectors
* Riders
* Vehicles
* Daily Assignments
* Collection Requests
* Collections/Collection Records where Admin management is supported

For each section verify:

* list
* details where applicable
* create where applicable
* edit where applicable
* delete where applicable
* activate/deactivate where applicable

Do NOT create fake CRUD operations.

Do NOT show a Delete/Edit button if the backend does not support the operation.

Do not invent API endpoints.

Use the actual backend API.

